  "content": "<title id=\"UGAMdcWFwoRrk2xmzsIcGmE9n2b\">二阶段-美术风格相关</title><grid id=\"Vj9HdfkoOoVqWqxgM9xchXGvnjf\"><column id=\"PNyEdDUANoFLEtxrg9lc7QeOnBh\" width-ratio=\"0.223877\"><img id=\"R5cTdzvwNofheBxsk5PcY69Xn4b\" name=\"999.jpg\" height=\"1448\" mime=\"image/jpeg\" scale=\"0.672192\" src=\"LZiYbivhcozvOgxttTfcuSK2ntb\" width=\"1086\"/></column><column id=\"InmmdAwwSouJdoxetDEcs2G1nxU\" width-ratio=\"0.247501\"><img id=\"HUqfd8SA4ohEtTxh835cN7lanhb\" name=\"image.png\" crop=\"[0.000000,0.000000,0.988100,1.000000]\" height=\"704\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.247959\" src=\"DcIibESmyoORuGxYK2jck7GOnne\" width=\"592\"/></column><column id=\"Z4SKdqTqao6nBfxPnSYcdM4onRh\" width-ratio=\"0.528622\"><img id=\"CLVvdvoSmocq6fxagMUcrLrmn2f\" name=\"img_v3_0215c_5ec41a54-a75f-433e-9e81-d6083da5967g.jpg\" height=\"504\" mime=\"image/jpeg\" scale=\"0.807522\" src=\"GUIubWuoNo7oDjxTpAecv89en3e\" width=\"904\"/></column></grid><p id=\"KGR9dRnZWoD2mixUMHlcSUb6nkf\">日韩卡通</p><p id=\"Ob5JdnX5DodWA0xCEh0c1v2pnpe\">透视：正交45度等距透视</p><p id=\"CCdjdpajho3K35x5AZvc2MjFnbg\">比例：2头身</p><p id=\"Z3BUdUTIro5gzOxf97FcAE8Yncb\">造型结构：简单概括（尽可能简化结构和造型）。</p><p id=\"UNdcdkg6goWLPZxtAxxcYUbknAh\">体积感：较弱（对比度低）。</p><p id=\"SxQIdNxuLonBN5xKqBVcJZfOnqf\">描边：有，实线（无肌理，无粗细深浅变化）取临近色块更深一些的颜色。</p><p id=\"SCNwdHplCotJYcxSAPtcLiPen5d\">色彩：鲜明，有些鲜艳（饱和度中度），干净明亮（明度高），深色重色较少。</p><p id=\"Fr9xditghoEpgRxPEnIcns8snac\">材质：弱或质感表达（高光+反光）。</p><p id=\"JLWhdA3V2oMkkgxvIIVcfcibnAc\">细节：较少，无笔触，无肌理，无渐变。</p><p id=\"DcEkdqDJ0oK52tx4wUvcBd2jnv1\">光影：较弱。</p><p id=\"NJtvdkXLVoDusaxay7lcohhVnyd\">设计：有一定的设计感。</p>",
